@startuml
title Manage Setting Sequence (Mobile local settings)

autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor Learner
boundary "Manage Setting UI" as SettingUi
control "AppSettingsNotifier\n(FE Controller)" as SettingsController
control "LocalStorage\n(Device)" as LocalStorage

note over SettingUi, LocalStorage
Checked in current code:
Mobile settings state exists in AppSettingsNotifier and AppSettingsState.
Settings are stored locally through LocalStorage.
No FE DTO, BE DTO, API controller, repository, DbContext or database is used.
Stored keys include app locale, theme and reminder/audio options.
end note

Learner -> SettingUi: Open settings
SettingUi -> SettingsController: load()
SettingsController -> LocalStorage: Read app setting keys
LocalStorage --> SettingsController: Stored values or defaults
SettingsController --> SettingUi: Show current settings

Learner -> SettingUi: Toggle setting option
SettingUi -> SettingsController: setDailyReminder()\nor setSoundEffects()
SettingsController -> LocalStorage: Save updated value
LocalStorage --> SettingsController: Saved
SettingsController -> SettingsController: Update AppSettingsState
SettingsController --> SettingUi: Refresh setting value

@enduml
